    the origin's HTML — this was breaking PeerTube ("Incompatible browser") and
    silently killing the banner on R3. The loader now renders a TOP bar (with
    body padding) instead of a bottom bar. Plus: strict-CSP responses fall back
    to the legacy inline-CSS buffer banner; bundle cache keyed by
    (client_id, is_wg). The R3 report link was NOT broken (wg=1 -> public kbin).

